# Renderer dependencies
_build/node_modules/
_build/package-lock.json

# Old template resume — superseded by the tracked Base one, kept out of git.
Faraaz_Mohammed_Resume.docx

# Tailored resumes and their renders ARE tracked, per application: the point of
# this repo is that a finished resume has a permanent link you can open on a
# phone, without a clone or a LibreOffice install. The tracker links each one.
# The Markdown source is tracked alongside its PDF on purpose — when the source
# and the artefact drift, the next re-render silently ships the stale one (that
# is exactly how the "Artifcial" typo reached the published base resume).

# Page-proof scratch from _build/proof.sh: regenerated every run and superseded
# by the named render that actually ships. Noise, not history.
draft.docx
draft.pdf
applications/*/draft.docx
applications/*/draft.pdf
